{"t":"Adventurer's Outpost","s":"adventurer-s-outpost-7ebf5","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Adventurer's Outpost</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Core</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Building</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1490 sqm</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"beds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Max. Beds</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">14</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Location</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dawnport</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"street\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Street</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Wilderness</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Features</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"openwindows\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Windows</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">16</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"floors\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Floors</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rooms\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rooms</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.55<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">September 15, 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Buildings <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-house-furnishings\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Furnishings\">Furnishings</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This house has no furnishings.</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-house-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145804&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png\"/>\n<div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\">\n<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32062,31884,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32062, 31884, 6)</a></div>\n<p>Center of the island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnport\">Dawnport</a>, on a hill.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-house-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<dl><dd></dd></dl>\n<p>A number of NPCs work in the outpost to assist new adventurers: <a href=\"#/wiki/Oressa\">Oressa</a> is the temple priestess; <a href=\"#/wiki/Wentworth\">Wentworth</a> runs the bank past the vocation rooms; <a href=\"#/wiki/Hamish\">Hamish</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Richard\">Richard</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Coltrayne\">Coltrayne</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Inigo\">Inigo</a> runs the shops; <a href=\"#/wiki/Garamond\">Garamond</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ser%20Tybald\">Ser Tybald</a> teach spells; <a href=\"#/wiki/Plunderpurse\">Plunderpurse</a> runs the bank; <a href=\"#/wiki/Mr%20Morris\">Mr Morris</a> is involved with the <a href=\"#/quest/dawnport-quest\">Dawnport Quest</a>.\n</p><p><br/>There are 4 exits from the outpost: each exit will change a character's vocation and provide that character with a specific set of items the first time through and certain items each time a character walks through. See the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnport\">Dawnport</a> article for further details.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Wilderness_Buildings\">Related Wilderness Buildings</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Bloodhall</li><li>Caveman Shelter</li><li>Demon Tower</li><li>Eastern House of Tranquility</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Manor\">Frost Manor</a></li><li>Halls of the Adventurers</li><li>Hill Hideout</li><li>House of Recreation</li><li>Lost Cavern</li><li>Low Waters Observatory</li><li>Meriana Beach</li><li>Moonkeep</li><li>Mountain Hideout</li><li>Nautic Observer</li><li>Nordic Stronghold</li><li>Old Sanctuary of God King Qjell</li><li>Shadow Towers</li><li>Snake Tower</li><li>Spiritkeep</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Suntower%20%28Blessing%29\">Suntower (Blessing)</a></li><li>The Hideout</li><li>The Lair</li><li>The Treehouse</li><li>The Yeah Beach Project</li><li>Venore Poorhouse</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["dawnport-quest","tutorial"]}